e thing to keep in mind: I won't import the sizeparse package since byte count suffixes aren't part of this task scope. Let me also check how the test environment handles locale settings...\n\nWriting test setup code... Writing the tail function... to io.EOF. The output correctly shows lines 2 and 3, so the edge case with missing trailing newlines is handled properly. I'm confident in this solution now, so let me start writing out the implementation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9898,"cache_read_input_tokens":25659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9898},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7572528e-a6da-4fdd-8b4b-68f7c8392313","uuid":"d79ef126-b8ca-4474-8dd4-4d0addc3d52f"}
